<title>INDIA: Indian castor markets to hold post-budget trade.</title>
<headline>Indian castor markets to hold post-budget trade.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian castorseed and edible oil markets will hold a post-budget session on Friday after Finance Minister P. Chidambaram unveils his budget in parliament at 1700 (1130 GMT), dealers said.</p>
<p>The markets will be open from 1730 to 1900 (1200 GMT to 1330 GMT) in addition to normal trading times of 1200-1430 (0630-0900 GMT).</p>
<p>On Thursday, castorseed prices were steady on subdued sentiment.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
